		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Gigantic, two-headed, wingless dragon with olivine scales.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 58, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +9 (2d10) and 2 claws +9 (2d8) or 1 acid breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (burrow), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Acid Breath</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) extending double near from linnorm. DEX 15+ or 4d8 damage. Organic material or metal hit dissolves on a d6 roll of 1-3.</p><p></p><p><strong>Acidblood</strong>. Acid immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Death Curse</strong>. When slain, death curses the slayer. WIS 15+ or cursed to be unable to regain HP.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
